# 手工端到端 Word Count 验证日志

- 时间：2026-10-27
- 测试程序：`src/main/mrcoordinator`、`src/main/mrworker`、`src/mrapps/wc.so`、`src/main/mrsequential`
- 输入：8 个 `src/main/pg-*.txt` 文件，nReduce=10，4 个并发 Worker
- 工作目录：`/tmp/mr-demo-final/dist`（临时目录，不进入仓库）

## 执行命令（摘要）
```bash
BASE=Exp1-MapReduce/mit-lab/src
src/main/mrcoordinator /tmp/mr-demo-final.sock src/main/pg-*.txt &
for i in 1 2 3 4; do src/main/mrworker src/mrapps/wc.so /tmp/mr-demo-final.sock & done
cat mr-out-* | LC_ALL=C sort > sorted.txt
src/main/mrsequential src/mrapps/wc.so src/main/pg-*.txt   # 串行基准
cmp dist/sorted.txt seq/seq-sorted.txt
```

